{"seq":4,"slug":"post-incident","title":"事后处置","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/post-incident","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"post-incident-review","title":"事后复盘与改进机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/post-incident/post-incident-review","wordCount":2638,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-evidence","title":"数字证据保全与司法协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/post-incident/digital-evidence","wordCount":2590,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"ir-automation","title":"事件响应自动化与 SOAR","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/post-incident/ir-automation","wordCount":2463,"readingTime":10}],"introMarkdown":"# 事后处置\n\n本章关注安全事件的事后处理与持续改进。事后复盘（Post-Incident Review）通过结构化的根因分析和时间线还原，提炼经验教训并转化为防御能力提升。数字证据保全与司法协作确保在法律层面维护组织权益，满足合规与取证要求。事件响应自动化与 SOAR 平台的引入，将重复性响应流程编排为自动化剧本（Playbook），大幅提升响应效率与一致性。\n"}